This standalone implementation reuses and adapts parser integration approaches
from NingyuSUN/bioai-evidence-validator (Apache-2.0), especially its 2026-11-06
local-paper pilot tools and TEI normalization. It has no runtime dependency on
that project. Changes include independent content-addressed storage, canonical
source locators, versioned conversion objects, review packets and admission gates.

The user's historical paper_text.py pipeline is integrated through explicit
input/output adapters. Its private snapshot and real paper outputs are not
distributed in this repository. External parsers and models retain their own
licenses. Paper copyright and access rights are not changed by ingestion.
